<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>DAY 3 | 데이터 대시보드 만들기</title>
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 64 64'%3E%3Crect x='4' y='8' width='12' height='48' rx='4' fill='%23da3c48'/%3E%3Crect x='19' y='8' width='12' height='48' rx='4' fill='%23d8539a'/%3E%3Crect x='34' y='8' width='12' height='48' rx='4' fill='%238a7cc0'/%3E%3Crect x='49' y='8' width='12' height='48' rx='4' fill='%235ab8b7'/%3E%3C/svg%3E">
<link rel="stylesheet" as="style" crossorigin
  href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/variable/pretendardvariable-dynamic-subset.min.css">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#f6f6f9; --card:#fff; --ink:#1c1b22; --dim:#5d5b68;
    --line:#e4e3ea; --code:#f3f2f7;
    --accent:#3b3577; --accent2:#6e5fb0; --red:#c8323f; --teal:#23807f;
    --grad:linear-gradient(90deg,#da3c48 0%,#d8539a 32%,#8a7cc0 64%,#7b9ecf 82%,#5ab8b7 100%);
    --sans:"Pretendard Variable",Pretendard,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI","Malgun Gothic","맑은 고딕",sans-serif;
    --mono:"D2Coding",Consolas,"Courier New",monospace;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--sans);line-height:1.72;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:-0.011em;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
  .wrap{max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px}

  .topline{height:6px;background:var(--grad)}
  header{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:22px 20px}
  header h1{margin:0;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.02em}
  .testmark{display:inline-block;margin-left:8px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;vertical-align:3px;background:#fff;color:var(--red);padding:1px 8px;border-radius:4px}

  nav{position:sticky;top:0;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:10px 0;z-index:10}
  nav>.wrap{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;align-items:center}
  nav>.urlbar{max-width:900px;margin:0 auto 9px;padding:0 20px 9px;display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line)}
  .urlbar .label{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;background:var(--accent);padding:3px 9px;border-radius:4px;align-self:center}
  .urlbar .addr{font-size:19px;font-weight:700;color:var(--red)}
  .urlbar .dl{margin-left:auto;align-self:center;background:var(--accent2);color:#fff;border:0;border-radius:6px;padding:6px 14px;font:inherit;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
  .urlbar .dl:hover{background:var(--accent)}
  .urlbar .dl.done{background:var(--teal)}
  nav .day{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--dim);margin:0 2px 0 8px}
  nav a{display:inline-block;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:20px;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none;background:var(--code)}
  nav a:hover{background:#e7e4f3}
  nav a.on{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;font-weight:700}

  .page{display:none;padding-bottom:30px}
  .page.on{display:block}
  section{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:22px;margin:18px 0}
  h2{font-size:20px;margin:0 0 4px;color:var(--accent);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.02em}
  .sub{color:var(--dim);font-size:14px;margin:0 0 14px}
  h3{font-size:16px;margin:20px 0 6px;font-weight:700}
  h3 small{font-weight:400;color:var(--dim);font-size:13px}
  .badge{display:inline-block;color:#fff;font-size:12.5px;padding:2px 9px;border-radius:4px;margin-right:7px;vertical-align:2px;background:var(--accent2)}

  .box{position:relative;background:var(--code);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:14px;margin:10px 0}
  pre{margin:0;white-space:pre-wrap;word-break:break-word;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.62;letter-spacing:0}
  .box pre{padding-right:66px}
  .copy{position:absolute;top:8px;right:8px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;color:var(--accent);border-radius:6px;padding:4px 12px;font-size:12.5px;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit}
  .copy:hover{background:var(--accent);color:#fff}
  .copy.done{background:var(--teal);color:#fff;border-color:var(--teal)}
  .auto{color:var(--accent2);font-weight:700}
  .wait{border:1.5px dashed var(--accent2);background:#fbfaff;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 14px;margin:10px 0;font-size:14.5px}

  .rec{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;padding:12px 14px;margin:10px 0;background:#fff}
  .rec h4{margin:0 0 6px;color:var(--accent);font-size:15.5px}
  .rec div{white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55}
  .logempty{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--dim);border:1.5px dashed var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px;margin:14px 0 0}
  .note{border-left:3px solid var(--accent2);background:#f3f1fa;padding:10px 14px;margin:12px 0;font-size:14.5px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0}
  .warn{border-left:3px solid var(--red);background:#fdf0f1;padding:10px 14px;margin:12px 0;font-size:14.5px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0}
  .save{display:inline-block;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--dim);background:var(--code);border-radius:6px;padding:4px 10px;margin-top:4px}
  .save b{color:var(--ink)}

  .steps{counter-reset:step;display:grid;gap:8px;margin:12px 0}
  .steps div{position:relative;padding:10px 12px 10px 42px;background:#fbfbfd;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;font-size:15px}
  .steps div:before{counter-increment:step;content:counter(step);position:absolute;left:12px;top:12px;width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;font-size:11px;font-weight:700}

  .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px;margin:12px 0}
  .cardbox{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;padding:14px;background:#fbfbfd;font-size:14.5px}
  .cardbox b{display:block;color:var(--accent);font-size:15px;margin-bottom:4px}

  /* 숫자 후보 고르기 */
  .picks{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px;margin:12px 0}
  .pick{display:block;border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;cursor:pointer}
  .pick input{margin-right:6px;transform:scale(1.15);vertical-align:-1px}
  .pick b{font-size:15.5px}
  .pick .q{display:block;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--dim);margin-top:2px}
  .pick .f{display:block;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--accent2);margin-top:6px}
  .pick.on{border-color:var(--accent2);background:#f3f1fa}
  .pick.off{opacity:.45;cursor:not-allowed}
  .count{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent2)}
  @media(max-width:650px){.grid,.picks{grid-template-columns:1fr}}

  table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:12px 0;font-size:14px}
  th,td{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:7px 10px;text-align:left}
  th{background:var(--code);font-weight:700}
  .n{text-align:right;white-space:nowrap}
  @media(max-width:650px){table{display:block;overflow-x:auto;white-space:nowrap}}

  .write{width:100%;min-height:84px;font:inherit;font-size:15px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink)}
  .reasons{display:grid;gap:8px;margin:8px 0 14px}
  .reasons .rrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
  .reasons .rname{flex:none;width:170px;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;color:var(--accent)}
  .reasons input{flex:1;min-width:0;font:inherit;font-size:15px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:9px 12px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink)}
  .reasons .empty{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--dim);border:1.5px dashed var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px}
  @media(max-width:650px){.reasons .rrow{flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;gap:4px}.reasons .rname{width:auto}}
  .ext{display:inline-block;margin-left:4px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent2);text-decoration:underline}
  .ext:hover{color:var(--accent)}

  /* 구조 그림 (2단계) */
  .wire{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:12px;background:#fff;display:grid;gap:9px;margin:10px 0 4px}
  .wire .row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:9px 12px}
  .wire .num{flex:none;justify-self:start;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--accent2);border-radius:4px;padding:1px 7px;line-height:1.5;white-space:nowrap}
  .wire .mid{display:grid;gap:6px}
  .wire .ttl{font-weight:700;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4}
  .wire .dim{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--dim)}
  .wire .grow{flex:1}
  .wire .btnlike{font-size:13px;border:1px solid var(--accent);color:var(--accent);border-radius:6px;padding:3px 11px;white-space:nowrap}
  .wire .cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:9px}
  .wire .col{background:#f3f1fa;border:1px solid #cfc9ea;border-radius:8px;padding:11px 12px}
  .wire .col .k{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--accent2)}
  .wire .col .ttl{color:var(--accent)}
  .wire .ph{display:flex;gap:5px;margin:10px 0 5px}
  .wire .ph i{flex:1;height:28px;border:1px dashed var(--accent2);border-radius:4px;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;color:var(--accent2);display:grid;place-items:center}
  .wire .bars{display:grid;gap:5px;margin:10px 0 5px}
  .wire .bars i{height:6px;border:1px dashed var(--accent2);border-radius:4px}
  .wire .lines{display:grid;gap:6px;margin-top:7px}
  .wire .lines i{height:1px;background:var(--line)}
  .wirecap{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--dim);margin:8px 0 0}
  .peek{margin-left:8px;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;background:var(--accent2);border:0;border-radius:5px;padding:2px 10px;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:1px}
  .peek:hover{background:var(--accent)}
  .modal{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:50;background:rgba(28,27,34,.55);display:grid;place-items:center;padding:20px}
  .modal[hidden]{display:none}
  .sheet{background:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px 18px;width:min(880px,100%);max-height:90vh;overflow:auto}
  .sheethead{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;color:var(--accent);font-size:16px}
  .closex{font:inherit;font-size:13px;color:var(--accent);background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:4px 12px;cursor:pointer}
  .closex:hover{background:var(--code)}
  @media print{.modal,.peek{display:none}}
  @media(max-width:650px){.wire .cols{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  .ask{font-size:16.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);margin:14px 0 6px}

  .pager{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;margin-top:8px}
  .btn{display:inline-block;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border:0;border-radius:6px;padding:9px 16px;font:inherit;font-size:14.5px;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none}
  .btn:hover{background:var(--accent2)}
  .btn.ghost{background:#fff;color:var(--accent);border:1.5px solid var(--accent)}

  .log td{vertical-align:top}
  .log input,.log select,.log textarea{font:inherit;font-size:13.5px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px;padding:3px 6px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink)}
  .log input{width:64px;text-align:right}
  .log textarea{width:100%;min-height:38px;resize:vertical}

  footer{color:var(--dim);font-size:13px;text-align:center;padding:24px 20px}
  @media print{nav{display:none}body{background:#fff}.copy,.pager{display:none}.page{display:block}}
  .lead{font-size:19px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);margin:12px 0 4px;letter-spacing:-0.02em}
  .days{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px;margin:14px 0}
  .dcard{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55}
  .dcard b{display:block;color:var(--accent);font-size:16px;margin-bottom:3px}
  .dcard.today{border:2px solid var(--red)}
  .dcard.today b{color:var(--red)}
  @media(max-width:650px){.days{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="topline"></div>
<header><div class="wrap"><h1>DAY 3 | 데이터 대시보드 만들기</h1></div></header>

<nav>
<div class="urlbar"><span class="label">실습 페이지</span><span class="addr">bit.ly/aiday03</span><button class="dl" id="copyData">상품본부 데이터 복사</button><button class="dl" id="csvData" style="margin-left:0">상품본부 CSV 내려받기</button></div>
<div class="wrap" id="menu">
  <a href="#start">시작</a>
  <a href="#p1">1 숫자 고르기</a>
  <a href="#p2">2 구조</a>
  <a href="#p3">3 숫자 카드</a>
  <a href="#p4">4 팀별 비교</a>
  <a href="#p5">5 판단 도구</a>
  <a href="#log">내 기록</a>
</div>
</nav>

<div class="wrap">

<!-- ==================== 시작 ==================== -->
<div class="page" id="start">
<section>
  <h2>오늘 할 일</h2>
  <p class="sub" style="margin:0">직책자 AI 모닝클래스 | 셋째 날</p>
  <p class="lead">숫자는 보이는데, 무엇이 문제인지는 기준이 정합니다.</p>
  <div class="days">
    <div class="dcard"><b>DAY 1</b>우리 팀<br>AI 업무분류표</div>
    <div class="dcard"><b>DAY 2</b>AI 의사결정<br>1PAGE</div>
    <div class="dcard today"><b>DAY 3~4 (오늘)</b>데이터<br>대시보드</div>
    <div class="dcard"><b>DAY 5</b>30일<br>Action Plan</div>
  </div>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="cardbox"><b>도구</b>기관이 준 <b style="display:inline;color:inherit;font-size:inherit">ChatGPT Edu</b> 계정 (개인 계정 아님) <a class="ext" href="https://chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ChatGPT 열기 ↗</a></div>
    <div class="cardbox"><b>오늘의 결과물</b>데이터 대시보드 V1 (꼭 볼 숫자 · 팀별 비교 · 판단 도구). 끝에 <b style="display:inline;color:inherit;font-size:inherit">대시보드_V1</b>로 저장하고, 내일 이 파일로 이어서 합니다.</div>
    <div class="cardbox"><b>데이터</b>숫자는 AI에 넣지 않습니다. 대시보드 화면에서 직접 넣습니다.</div>
    <div class="cardbox"><b>오늘 답할 것</b>다음 회의에서 먼저 부를 팀 1곳과 그 이유 · ✏️ 바꿔 쓸 곳 · ⭐ 시간이 남으면</div>
  </div>
  <div class="note">어제 1PAGE에서 본 '판단에 더 필요한 데이터'를 오늘은 숫자로 봅니다.</div>
  <div class="cardbox"><b>화면을 반으로 나누면 편합니다</b>이 실습 페이지는 <b style="display:inline;color:inherit;font-size:inherit">Windows 키 + ←</b>, ChatGPT는 <b style="display:inline;color:inherit;font-size:inherit">Windows 키 + →</b>. 창을 클릭한 뒤 Windows 키를 누른 채 화살표를 누르면 화면 절반에 붙습니다.</div>
  <div class="pager"><span></span><a class="btn" href="#p1">1 숫자 고르기 →</a></div>
</section>
</div>

<!-- ==================== 3일차 ==================== -->
<div class="page" id="p1">
<section>
  <h2><span class="badge">1</span>꼭 볼 숫자 3개 고르기</h2>
  <p class="sub">AI 없이 합니다 · 가상 상품본부의 올해 데이터입니다 (단위 백만 원, 목표 = 올해 사업계획)</p>
  <table>
    <tr><th rowspan="2">팀</th><th colspan="3" style="text-align:center">판로지원액 (백만 원)</th><th colspan="2" style="text-align:center">공헌이익 (백만 원)</th><th rowspan="2">비고</th></tr><tr><th class="n">목표</th><th class="n">실적</th><th class="n">전년 실적</th><th class="n">목표</th><th class="n">실적</th></tr>
    <tr><td>생활팀</td><td class="n">960</td><td class="n">1,062</td><td class="n">900</td><td class="n">72</td><td class="n">76</td><td>소형가전 판매 호조</td></tr>
    <tr><td>패션팀</td><td class="n">1,200</td><td class="n">972</td><td class="n">1,130</td><td class="n">96</td><td class="n">75</td><td>주력 브랜드 방송 취소</td></tr>
    <tr><td>문화팀</td><td class="n">1,520</td><td class="n">1,410</td><td class="n">1,390</td><td class="n">68</td><td class="n">80</td><td></td></tr>
    <tr><td>신선식품팀</td><td class="n">1,120</td><td class="n">1,052</td><td class="n">1,040</td><td class="n">80</td><td class="n">78</td><td></td></tr>
    <tr><td>가공식품팀</td><td class="n">1,680</td><td class="n">1,790</td><td class="n">1,610</td><td class="n">120</td><td class="n">108</td><td>명절 선물세트 방송 추가</td></tr>
    <tr><td>건강뷰티팀</td><td class="n">1,040</td><td class="n">1,081</td><td class="n">960</td><td class="n">90</td><td class="n">96</td><td>신규 브랜드 입점</td></tr>
  </table>
  <p class="ask">표의 숫자로 계산할 수 있는 값입니다. 꼭 볼 숫자 3개를 고르세요. <span class="count" id="pickCount">0 / 3</span></p>
  <div class="picks" id="picks"></div>
  <p class="ask">고른 이유를 한 줄씩 적어 보세요 <small style="font-weight:400;color:var(--dim);font-size:13.5px">이 숫자가 목표에서 벗어나면 나는 무엇을 하는가?</small></p>
  <div class="reasons" id="reasons"></div>
  <div class="pager"><a class="btn ghost" href="#start">← 시작</a><a class="btn" href="#p2">2 구조 만들기 →</a></div>
</section>
</div>

<div class="page" id="p2">
<section>
  <h2><span class="badge">2</span>대시보드 구조 만들기</h2>
  <p class="sub">ChatGPT 새 채팅 · 숫자 없이 화면의 구조만 만듭니다</p>
  <div class="modal" id="wireModal" hidden>
  <div class="sheet">
  <div class="sheethead"><b>[화면 구성] 예시</b><button type="button" class="closex" aria-label="닫기">닫기 ✕</button></div>
  <div class="wire">
    <div class="row"><span class="num">구성 1</span><div class="grow"><div class="ttl">상품본부 성과 대시보드</div><div class="dim">교육용 예시 · 가상 데이터</div></div><span class="num">구성 5</span><span class="btnlike">데이터 넣기</span><span class="btnlike">데이터 지우기</span></div>
    <div class="mid"><span class="num">구성 2</span>
      <div class="col"><div class="k">칸 1</div><div class="ttl">꼭 볼 숫자</div><div class="ph"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="k">숫자 카드 자리 3개 · 가로 한 줄</div></div>
    </div>
